. * EXTRACT AND EXPORT RESULTS * 
. 
.         * Extract the required statistics
. 
.                 * (i) difference in coefficient estimate of daughters for fat
> hers and mothers
.                 local coefficient = _b[m_father_mean:1.daughter]-_b[m_mother_
> mean:1.daughter]

. 
.                 * (ii) Chi2 value
.                 local chi2=  r(chi2)

. 
.                 * ADDED
.                 * (ii) Standard error (from lincom)
.                 lincom [m_father_mean]1.daughter - [m_mother_mean]1.daughter

